\begin{description}
\item[* name:] RIdNPFormation2
\item[* relevant examples:] detless NP(salida) in for example 'callejon sin 
salida'
\item[* language:] (Dutch, English, Spanish) Spanish
\item[* kind of rule:] (M-rule, S-rule, Transferrule) M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] IdiomFormation
\item[* class:] (name of rule, transformation or filter class) Npformationrule
\item[* date of creation:] 06-DEC-1990
